  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mekong Plastics Innovation Hub</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment supports innovative plastic-pollution solutions across Mekong subregion countries through an innovation program led by CSIRO&#x2019;s Indo-Pacific Plastics Innovation Network (IPPIN). TThe program strengthens research collaboration through capacity building, scales promising solutions, and advances innovations toward market adoption. It aims to position IPPIN as a key regional partner that supports the innovation ecosystem and drives collaboration for sustainable plastic-waste reduction.</narrative>
  </description>
